<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>هوامش كتاب عيون الاخبار - الجزء الثاني</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/styles.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --page-sidebar-width: 120px;
            --word-sidebar-width: 200px;
            --zen-bg: #faf8f5;
            --zen-surface: #fffdf9;
            --zen-surface-soft: #f4f0e8;
            --zen-border: #d8d1c5;
            --zen-text: #3f3a33;
            --zen-muted: #6f675d;
            --zen-accent: #7f8f80;
            --zen-accent-strong: #657463;
            --zen-warm: #b88a69;
            --zen-highlight: #f1e3c5;
            --zen-radius: 12px;
            --zen-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(93, 78, 64, 0.08);
        }

        body.zen-reading[data-zen-theme="earth"] {
            --zen-bg: #faf8f5;
            --zen-surface: #fffdf9;
            --zen-surface-soft: #f4f0e8;
            --zen-border: #d8d1c5;
            --zen-text: #3f3a33;
            --zen-muted: #6f675d;
            --zen-accent: #7f8f80;
            --zen-accent-strong: #657463;
            --zen-warm: #b88a69;
            --zen-highlight: #f1e3c5;
        }

        body.zen-reading[data-zen-theme="sage"] {
            --zen-bg: #f5f8f3;
            --zen-surface: #fbfef9;
            --zen-surface-soft: #edf4ea;
            --zen-border: #c8d5c8;
            --zen-text: #2f3a31;
            --zen-muted: #607063;
            --zen-accent: #7b9a83;
            --zen-accent-strong: #5f7866;
            --zen-warm: #b59a78;
            --zen-highlight: #e8f0df;
        }

        body.zen-reading[data-zen-theme="mist"] {
            --zen-bg: #f4f7f8;
            --zen-surface: #fcfefe;
            --zen-surface-soft: #ecf1f2;
            --zen-border: #c7d1d4;
            --zen-text: #334044;
            --zen-muted: #5b6c72;
            --zen-accent: #78939b;
            --zen-accent-strong: #5d747b;
            --zen-warm: #b08d79;
            --zen-highlight: #dfecef;
        }

        body.zen-reading[data-zen-theme="rose"] {
            --zen-bg: #faf5f3;
            --zen-surface: #fffcfb;
            --zen-surface-soft: #f5ece8;
            --zen-border: #ddcac2;
            --zen-text: #443632;
            --zen-muted: #745f58;
            --zen-accent: #9a7f74;
            --zen-accent-strong: #7b645c;
            --zen-warm: #b88368;
            --zen-highlight: #f2ded5;
        }
        
        #pageSidebar {
            width: var(--page-sidebar-width) !important;
        }
        
        #wordSidebar {
            width: var(--word-sidebar-width) !important;
        }

        #pageListScroll {
            scrollbar-width: none;
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
        }

        #pageListScroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        mark.search-highlight {
            background-color: var(--zen-highlight);
            color: #2f2a24;
            padding: 0 0.15rem;
            border-radius: 0.2rem;
        }

        body.zen-reading {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #f5f0e7 0%, var(--zen-bg) 55%);
            color: var(--zen-text);
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        body.zen-reading header {
            background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.94) !important;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zen-border) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(64, 50, 37, 0.03);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        }

        body.zen-reading h1 {
            color: var(--zen-accent-strong) !important;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        }

        body.zen-reading input,
        body.zen-reading button,
        body.zen-reading select,
        body.zen-reading textarea {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        body.zen-reading input {
            background: #fffefb !important;
            border-color: var(--zen-border) !important;
            color: var(--zen-text) !important;
            box-shadow: none !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading input:focus {
            border-color: var(--zen-accent) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(127, 143, 128, 0.18) !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading .page-button {
            background: #fffefb;
            border: 1px solid var(--zen-border);
            color: var(--zen-muted);
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }

        body.zen-reading .page-button:hover {
            background: #f3eee5;
            border-color: #cbbfae;
            color: var(--zen-text);
        }

        body.zen-reading .active-page {
            background: #e9efe7 !important;
            border: 1px solid #b8c8b8 !important;
            color: #4f5f51 !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading .word-button {
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            color: var(--zen-text);
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }

        body.zen-reading .word-button:hover {
            background: #f7f2ea;
            border-color: #e5dccf;
        }

        body.zen-reading .active-word {
            background: #f4ecdf !important;
            border-right: 4px solid var(--zen-warm) !important;
            font-weight: 700 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #pageSidebar,
        body.zen-reading #wordSidebar {
            background: var(--zen-surface-soft) !important;
            border-left: 1px solid #e3dacb !important;
            box-shadow: none !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #wordSidebar {
            background: #fbf8f2 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #mobilePagesBox,
        body.zen-reading #mobileWordsBox,
        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchPanel {
            background: var(--zen-surface) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--zen-border) !important;
            border-radius: var(--zen-radius) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(92, 76, 59, 0.05);
        }

        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchModal > div {
            background: var(--zen-surface) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--zen-border);
            box-shadow: var(--zen-shadow);
        }

        body.zen-reading #selectedPageLabel,
        body.zen-reading #mobileSelectedPageLabel {
            background: #c9d8ca !important;
            color: #344035 !important;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        body.zen-reading #wordsHeader,
        body.zen-reading #mobileWordsHeader {
            background: #f2eee6 !important;
            color: #6c7767 !important;
            border: 1px solid #dfd3c2;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        body.zen-reading #welcomeMessage {
            color: #8a8074 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #detailsArea {
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        body.zen-reading #detailsArea > .flex:first-child {
            border-bottom-color: #ded4c7 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #detailsArea > .flex:nth-child(2) > div:first-child {
            background: #eee7db !important;
            color: #6a604f !important;
            border: 1px solid #ddd0be;
        }

        body.zen-reading #detailsArea > .flex:nth-child(2) > div:last-child {
            background: #e4eee2 !important;
            color: #4d5f4e !important;
            border: 1px solid #cad8ca;
        }

        body.zen-reading #detailsArea > .bg-white {
            background: var(--zen-surface) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--zen-border) !important;
            border-radius: calc(var(--zen-radius) + 2px) !important;
            box-shadow: var(--zen-shadow) !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #displayInfo {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            color: #2f2b26 !important;
            font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
            line-height: 2.35;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
            word-spacing: 0.07em;
            max-width: 72ch;
            margin-inline: auto;
            text-wrap: pretty;
        }

        body.zen-reading #displayInfo p,
        body.zen-reading #displayInfo li,
        body.zen-reading #displayInfo div {
            max-width: 72ch;
            margin-inline: auto;
        }

        body.zen-reading #displayInfo hr {
            border-top-color: #c9bead;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        body.zen-reading #mediaContainer {
            border-top-color: #dfd5c8 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #prevWord,
        body.zen-reading #nextWord,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseFont,
        body.zen-reading #resetFont,
        body.zen-reading #increaseFont,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseWidth,
        body.zen-reading #resetWidth,
        body.zen-reading #increaseWidth,
        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchToggle,
        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchClear,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchGo,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchCancel,
        body.zen-reading #focusModeToggle {
            border-radius: 10px !important;
            min-height: 42px;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }

        body.zen-reading #prevWord {
            background: #f1ece3 !important;
            color: #4d453d !important;
            border: 1px solid #ddd1bf;
        }

        body.zen-reading #prevWord:hover {
            background: #e7ddd0 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #nextWord,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchGo {
            background: #7f8f80 !important;
            color: #fffefb !important;
            border: 1px solid #6a7b69;
        }

        body.zen-reading #nextWord:hover,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchGo:hover {
            background: #6f7f70 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchToggle,
        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchClear,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchCancel,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseFont,
        body.zen-reading #resetFont,
        body.zen-reading #increaseFont,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseWidth,
        body.zen-reading #resetWidth,
        body.zen-reading #increaseWidth,
        body.zen-reading #focusModeToggle {
            background: #fbf7ef !important;
            color: var(--zen-muted) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--zen-border) !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchToggle:hover,
        body.zen-reading #advancedSearchClear:hover,
        body.zen-reading #mobileAdvancedSearchCancel:hover,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseFont:hover,
        body.zen-reading #resetFont:hover,
        body.zen-reading #increaseFont:hover,
        body.zen-reading #decreaseWidth:hover,
        body.zen-reading #resetWidth:hover,
        body.zen-reading #increaseWidth:hover,
        body.zen-reading #focusModeToggle:hover {
            background: #f1eae0 !important;
            border-color: #cdbfae !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #focusModeToggle[aria-pressed="true"] {
            background: #e9efe7 !important;
            color: #4a5c4b !important;
            border-color: #b8c8b8 !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenThemeSelect {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            width: 1px;
            height: 1px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-palette-picker {
            position: relative;
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenPaletteButton {
            width: 74px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ab9e8e;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), 0 1px 4px rgba(70, 56, 42, 0.2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
            background-color: #efe8db;
            background-size: cover;
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenPaletteButton:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6), 0 3px 8px rgba(70, 56, 42, 0.25);
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenPaletteButton:focus-visible {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #7d8e8f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(122, 145, 155, 0.25), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenPaletteMenu {
            position: absolute;
            top: calc(100% + 6px);
            left: 0;
            background: #fffcf8;
            border: 1px solid #cabdae;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(72, 58, 44, 0.18);
            padding: 6px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 6px;
            min-width: 116px;
            z-index: 1200;
        }

        body.zen-reading #zenPaletteMenu.hidden {
            display: none;
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch {
            width: 48px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(57, 45, 35, 0.35);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch[data-theme="earth"] {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f3e7d2 0 33%, #7f8f80 33% 66%, #b67a54 66% 100%);
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch[data-theme="sage"] {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dfe9d7 0 33%, #6f9178 33% 66%, #c59b72 66% 100%);
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch[data-theme="mist"] {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dde7ea 0 33%, #6f8f9a 33% 66%, #9b7b67 66% 100%);
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch[data-theme="rose"] {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f1ddda 0 33%, #96746a 33% 66%, #c07b62 66% 100%);
        }

        body.zen-reading .zen-swatch.is-active {
            border-color: #2f2b26;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(47, 43, 38, 0.2);
        }

        /* Feature Pop-up Styles */
        .feature-popup {
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ede5d8 0%, #d4ddcf 100%);
            color: #3f3a33;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--zen-radius);
            border: 1px solid #d4c7b8;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(84, 67, 50, 0.14);
            max-width: 280px;
            font-size: 14px;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite, appearPop 0.6s ease-out;
            top: 85px;
            left: 15px;
        }

        .feature-popup::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -12px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-left: 10px solid transparent;
            border-right: 10px solid transparent;
            border-bottom: 12px solid #e5dccf;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(77, 62, 46, 0.2));
        }

        .feature-popup-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .feature-popup-text {
            flex: 1;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .feature-popup-close {
            background: rgba(101, 116, 99, 0.18);
            border: none;
            color: #465245;
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0;
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .feature-popup-close:hover {
            background: rgba(101, 116, 99, 0.3);
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0px);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-8px);
            }
        }

        @keyframes appearPop {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(10px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #pageSidebar,
        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #wordSidebar,
        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #mobilePagesBox,
        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #mobileWordsBox,
        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #menuToggle {
            display: none !important;
        }

        body.zen-reading.focus-mode main {
            max-width: 1080px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        }

        body.zen-reading.focus-mode #detailsArea {
            max-width: 860px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 767px) {
            body.zen-reading #displayInfo {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                line-height: 2.2;
            }

            body.zen-reading #focusModeToggle {
                flex: 1;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body class="zen-reading h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Feature Pop-up -->
    <div id="featurePopup" class="feature-popup" style="display: none;">
        <div class="feature-popup-content">
            <span class="text-xl">✨</span>
            <div class="feature-popup-text">تحديث جديد: البحث المتقدم</div>
            <button class="feature-popup-close" id="featurePopupClose">×</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b p-3 sm:p-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1fr)_minmax(420px,640px)_minmax(220px,1fr)] items-center gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 w-full md:justify-self-start">
            <button id="menuToggle" class="md:hidden p-2 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-lg" aria-label="Toggle menu">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
            <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-blue-800 flex-1 sm:flex-none">هوامش كتاب عيون الاخبار - الجزء الثاني</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:justify-self-center">
            <div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2 w-full">
                <input 
                    type="text" 
                    id="searchInput" 
                    placeholder="ابحث عن كلمة..." 
                    class="border rounded-lg px-3 sm:px-4 py-2 flex-1 min-w-0 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none">
                <button id="advancedSearchToggle" class="border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm flex-shrink-0" title="بحث متقدم">
                    🔎
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 justify-self-end">
                <div class="zen-palette-picker">
                    <button id="zenPaletteButton" type="button" aria-label="ألوان القراءة" aria-expanded="false" title="ألوان القراءة"></button>
                    <div id="zenPaletteMenu" class="hidden" role="menu" aria-label="اختيار لوحة الألوان">
                        <button type="button" class="zen-swatch" data-theme="earth" title="Earth" role="menuitem"></button>
                        <button type="button" class="zen-swatch" data-theme="sage" title="Sage" role="menuitem"></button>
                        <button type="button" class="zen-swatch" data-theme="mist" title="Mist" role="menuitem"></button>
                        <button type="button" class="zen-swatch" data-theme="rose" title="Rose" role="menuitem"></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <select id="zenThemeSelect" class="text-sm" title="ألوان القراءة">
                    <option value="earth" title="Earth"> </option>
                    <option value="sage" title="Sage"> </option>
                    <option value="mist" title="Mist"> </option>
                    <option value="rose" title="Rose"> </option>
                </select>
                <button id="focusModeToggle" class="p-2 rounded-lg text-sm" type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="وضع التركيز">
                    وضع التركيز
                </button>
                <button id="decreaseWidth" class="p-2 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-lg text-sm" title="تقليل العرض">−</button>
                <button id="resetWidth" class="px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 rounded" title="إعادة تعيين">إعادة</button>
                <button id="increaseWidth" class="p-2 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-lg text-sm" title="زيادة العرض">+</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Advanced Search Panel -->
    <div id="advancedSearchPanel" class="hidden bg-white border-b border-gray-200 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="max-w-full mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-3">
            <input
                type="text"
                id="advancedSearchInput"
                placeholder="بحث متقدم عن كلمة أو معلومات..."
                class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 w-full sm:flex-1 min-w-0 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none">
            <button id="advancedSearchClear" class="w-full sm:w-auto border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm">مسح البحث</button>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">يبحث هذا في جميع الكلمات والمعلومات داخل البيانات كاملة ويعرض النتائج في مربع قائمة الكلمات.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Advanced Search Modal -->
    <div id="mobileAdvancedSearchModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 p-4">
        <div class="w-full max-w-lg rounded-3xl bg-white p-4 shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold">بحث متقدم</h2>
                <button id="mobileAdvancedSearchClose" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900">✕</button>
            </div>
            <input
                type="text"
                id="mobileAdvancedSearchInput"
                placeholder="ابحث عن كلمة أو معلومات..."
                class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 w-full text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none">
            <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2">
                <button id="mobileAdvancedSearchGo" class="flex-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 hover:bg-blue-700 text-sm">بحث</button>
                <button id="mobileAdvancedSearchCancel" class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 text-sm">إلغاء</button>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">استخدم هذا الزر للحصول على نتائج في مربع قائمة الكلمات.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <div class="flex flex-1 overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Desktop Page Sidebar -->
        <aside id="pageSidebar" class="hidden md:flex flex-col bg-gray-100 border-l p-2 text-center">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 pt-0 pb-1">
                <input 
                    type="text" 
                    id="pageSearchInput" 
                    placeholder="ابحث عن صفحة" 
